---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lang = 'zh-TW' as const;
---

<Layout
  title="隱私權政策 - AI Resume Advisor"
  description="了解 AI Resume Advisor 如何保護你的資料。我們以安全的方式處理履歷和個人資訊，重視你的隱私。閱讀完整隱私權政策。"
  lang={lang}
>
  <Header lang={lang} />

  <main class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-50 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="mb-16 text-center">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary md:text-5xl">
          隱私權政策
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-caption">最後更新：2025 年 12 月 10 日</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >1</span
            >
            簡介
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-text-body">
            <p>
              AI Resume Advisor LLC（以下簡稱「我們」或「本公司」）尊重並保護你的隱私。本隱私權政策說明當你使用我們的網站、網頁應用程式及瀏覽器擴充功能（「AI Resume Advisor for LinkedIn」Chrome Extension）時，我們如何蒐集、使用、分享及保護你的個人資訊。使用我們的服務即表示你同意本政策所述之做法。
            </p>
            <p>
              本公司主要辦公地址為：<strong
                >30 N Gould St Ste N Sheridan, WY 82801</strong
              >。
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >2</span
            >
            我們蒐集的資訊
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-text-body">
            <p>我們可能蒐集以下類型的資訊：</p>
            <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">帳號資訊</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  建立帳號時提供的姓名、電子郵件地址和密碼。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">履歷內容</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  履歷文字、職缺描述、LinkedIn 資料、匹配分數及模擬器選擇項目。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">職涯資訊</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">工作偏好、目標職位、期望薪資等。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">使用資訊</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">瀏覽的頁面、使用的功能、建立的文件等。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">裝置資訊</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  裝置類型、作業系統、瀏覽器、IP 位址、語言偏好。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">付款資訊</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  透過第三方支付處理商（Stripe）安全處理。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">擴充功能資料</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  你分析的 LinkedIn 頁面上的職缺內容，僅暫時儲存以供處理。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-caption">
              我們僅蒐集提供服務所必要的資訊，並致力於保護你的隱私。
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 - Browser Extension -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >3</span
            >
            瀏覽器擴充功能
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-text-body">
            <p>
              當你使用我們的 Chrome Extension（「AI Resume Advisor for LinkedIn」）時，我們會蒐集並處理與擴充功能相關的額外資訊：
            </p>

            <div class="mt-4">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">透過擴充功能蒐集的資料</h3>
              <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span><strong>LinkedIn 職缺頁面資料：</strong>你主動分析的 LinkedIn 職缺刊登中的職稱、公司名稱、職缺描述和要求。</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span><strong>本機儲存資料：</strong>驗證 Token 和使用者偏好設定，儲存在你的瀏覽器本機中。</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">擴充功能的運作方式</h3>
              <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-success" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span>僅在你主動使用「分析」功能時，才會讀取 LinkedIn 職缺頁面的內容。</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-success" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span>與我們的伺服器（app.airesumeadvisor.com）通訊以處理你的分析請求。</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-success" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span>未主動使用擴充功能時，不會在背景蒐集任何資料。</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">擴充功能權限說明</h3>
              <div class="mt-2 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">storage</span>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-caption">在本機儲存登入狀態和偏好設定</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">activeTab</span>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-caption">點擊時存取目前的 LinkedIn 職缺頁面</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">scripting</span>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-caption">擷取職缺刊登資訊以進行分析</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2">
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">identity</span>
                  <p class="text-xs text-text-caption">啟用安全的 LinkedIn OAuth 驗證</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-error/30 bg-error/5 p-4">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">擴充功能不會蒐集的資料</h3>
              <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-text-body">
                <li>• 你的一般瀏覽紀錄</li>
                <li>• LinkedIn 訊息、人脈或私人個人檔案資料</li>
                <li>• 你未主動分析的頁面資料</li>
                <li>• 擴充功能彈出視窗關閉時的任何資訊</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >4</span
            >
            我們如何使用你的資訊
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 text-text-body">
            <p class="mb-4">我們使用蒐集的資訊來：</p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-success"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>提供與改善我們的服務</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-success"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>個人化你的使用體驗</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-success"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>進行分析與研究</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-success"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>與你溝通聯繫</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 text-success"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>保護我們的合法權益</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >5</span
            >
            資訊分享與揭露
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-text-body">
            <p>
              我們重視你的隱私，並嚴格限制你的資訊分享。在以下情況下，我們可能會分享你的資訊：
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span
                  class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-light text-xs font-medium text-primary"
                  >a</span
                >
                <span
                  ><strong>經你明確同意：</strong>僅在你明確同意的情況下，我們才會與第三方分享你的資料。</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span
                  class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-light text-xs font-medium text-primary"
                  >b</span
                >
                <span
                  ><strong>服務提供商：</strong>協助我們提供服務的第三方供應商（例如雲端儲存、支付處理商）。</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span
                  class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-light text-xs font-medium text-primary"
                  >c</span
                >
                <span
                  ><strong>法律要求：</strong>法律規定或為保護我們的合法權益時。</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span
                  class="mt-1 flex h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-light text-xs font-medium text-primary"
                  >d</span
                >
                <span
                  ><strong>業務轉讓：</strong>在合併、收購或資產出售的情況下。</span
                >
              </li>
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border-2 border-primary-light bg-primary-light/50 p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary">
                未經你的明確許可，我們絕不會為了行銷目的而將你的個人資訊或履歷資料出售、出租或分享給任何第三方。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 6 -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >6</span
            >
            Cookie 與追蹤技術
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-text-body">
            <p>
              我們使用 Cookie 和類似的追蹤技術來改善你的使用體驗。我們使用的 Cookie 類型包括：
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">必要 Cookie</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  網站基本功能所必需，例如維持你的登入狀態。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">分析 Cookie</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  幫助我們了解網站的使用方式，以改善使用者體驗。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">功能性 Cookie</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
                  記住你的選擇（語言、偏好設定），提供個人化體驗。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 p-4">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-text-primary">廣告 Cookie</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm">可能用於提供與你興趣相關的廣告。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
              你可以透過瀏覽器設定控制 Cookie。我們的網站也會回應「不追蹤」（Do Not Track）訊號。
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 7 -->
        <section class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
          <h2
            class="flex items-center gap-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-2xl"
          >
            <span
              class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-sm font-bold text-white"
              >7</span
            >
            你的權利
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-6 text-text-body">
            <p class="mb-4">
              根據適用的資料保護法律，你可能享有以下權利：
            </p>
            <div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3"
              >
                <svg
                  class="h-5 w-5 text-primary"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">存取你的資料</span>
              </div>
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3"
              >
                <svg
                  class="h-5 w-5 text-primary"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">更正不正確的資料</span>
              </div>
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3"
              >
                <svg
                  class="h-5 w-5 text-primary"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">刪除你的資料</span>
              </div>
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3"
              >
                <svg
                  class="h-5 w-5 text-primary"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">限制處理</span>
              </div>
              <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3"
              >
                <svg
                  class="h-5 w-5 text-primary"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium">資料可攜性</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-6 text-sm">
              如需行使這些權利，請寄信至 <a
                href="mailto:wenhao@airesumeadvisor.com"
